MODULE: ResolvedFailedPublicationClears
TARGET: ProjectionOnce
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: Failed candidate publication clears original-tail suppression and its retry projects late duplicates again
PERTURBS: PublishCheckpoint

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<tail,owner,resolved,order,prepared,terminal,stagedOwner,
        read,heads,projections,candidate,capturedHead>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ resolved' = IF outcome' # "success" THEN FALSE ELSE resolved
    /\ order' = IF outcome' # "success" THEN <<>> ELSE order
    /\ UNCHANGED <<tail,owner,prepared,terminal,stagedOwner,
        read,heads,projections,candidate,capturedHead>>
--- END
